  "ingredients": [
    "3 ripe bananas, mashed",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup melted butter",
    "1 egg",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease a 9x5-inch loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nDaH27qPraoXShH_CbOnCUGiyfU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241707-joys-easy-banana-bread-ddmfs-3205-4x3-step-01-20c16ef47a4d4738a51b9875816969cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241707/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine bananas, sugar, butter, and egg in a bowl. Whisk flour and baking soda together in a separate bowl; stir into banana mixture until batter is just mixed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s6yCoElCYnE8_93I3yb-BlcNfF0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241707-joys-easy-banana-bread-step-3-mfs-271-3x4-ce927226d7d046b1995cf6d93e4d7fd8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241707/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in salt; transfer batter to the prepared loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V-rBBexc_cj18uajBYloTQShRn0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241707-joys-easy-banana-bread-step-4-mfs-274-3x4-8a14560974e14e5d8f686a5e1d877558.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241707/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OhkfABCKAU8VRCAPD6T1ie41XOM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241707-joys-easy-banana-bread-step-5-mfs-277-3x4-bcc8ab16339f4317869e9ac01d6a4ae1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241707/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
